  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  day: 3
  title: Privacy Policy
  desc: "<size=125%><b>PRIVACY NOTICE UPDATE</b></size>\n\nLast updated May 18, 2025\n\nWe\u2019ve
    made changes to our <link=\"https://snapgram-inc.github.io/privacy-policy-2.html\"><color=#B4114B><u>Privacy
    Notice</u></color></link> to reflect how SnapGram integrates with new third-party
    features.\n\n\u2022 We now collect limited metadata when you use external filters
    or share content to connected platforms  \n\u2022 More clarity has been added
    on how these features affect your privacy settings\n\nTo understand how these
    updates may affect you, please review the full <link=\"https://snapgram-inc.github.io/privacy-policy-2.html\"><color=#B4114B><u>Privacy
    Notice</u></color></link>. If you have any questions, reach out to us at <link=\"mailto:vt387@drexel.edu\"><u>vt387@drexel.edu</u></link>.\n"
