  day: 8
  title: Privacy Policy
  desc: "<size=125%><b>PRIVACY NOTICE UPDATED</b></size>\n\nLast updated May 23,
    2025\n\nWe\u2019ve revised our <link=\"https://snapgram-inc.github.io/privacy-policy-3.html\"><color=#B4114B><u>Privacy
    Notice</u></color></link> to make it easier to understand and more transparent.\n\n\u2022
    Simplified explanations of how we process your personal information  \n\u2022
    Added examples to better explain your rights and our practices\n\nThese are not
    changes to what data we collect, but how we explain it. Read the updated <link=\"https://snapgram-inc.github.io/privacy-policy-3.html\"><color=#B4114B><u>Privacy
    Notice</u></color></link> to stay informed. Questions? Contact us at <link=\"mailto:vt387@drexel.edu\"><u>vt387@drexel.edu</u></link>.\n"
